      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那之后，\n我们喝着黄金船推荐的蜂蜜生姜茶，\n度过了悠闲的时光……",
      "source_fingerprint": "742b30eee9cb988bac9d0728803b60069c33a19301d955819c5dbf4671052509",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
