    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08b074f269afaaf832212629",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突然出现在眼前的赛马娘是黄金船。\n虽然她总是不按牌理出牌，但很有实力，\n是其中一名炒热现今草地竞赛的赛马娘──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e2dce5b51a614cc710ca04c322bb8469e0b911e5f902cd9a2dc13082a2c0f22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099102.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e856df0007a258cd3ced525",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然因为主战场不同没有一起奔跑过，\n但她也是和北港火山同期的选手……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4c6c576f2b7170c9ee935f4731852ef09cd570533189da8e149ca7fe8aa3c40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
