      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谁都知道\n踏上寻找失落秘宝的冒险要带上搭档吧！？\n我是不会把黄金山椒鱼交出来的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "458d7fc11744b3f80347ac0fc8f43f195d27438fdcdcba533103aebfd063f7d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
